    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "We follow [16, 8]. One has an observation process Yt = 0 t h(Xs,Ys)ds+Bt⊥ where the signal process X is assumed to have “correlated” dynamics,"
